body:
Journal #50, sample of 210 formalizer-v1 + 55 OOD rows. Systematic defects:

- relation phrases that paraphrase the message ("handed in notice" → resign, grandparents → parent-of chain, "whose loan" → borrow, "caused the delay" → postponed because of, "ce are X" → avea de vanzare, vaccinated → vaccinated against the flu);
- world assumptions restating the query through another relation (raise vs parent of);
- noise corrupting Romanian presupposition triggers ("mai" → "May", "inca") because JavaScript `\b` is ASCII-only;
- "what made she sick"; abduction pairing "stays home" with attending an event.

Result after fixes (journal #53): five independent audits; label defect rate from about 4% to **0/150** in the final audit; naturalness-only defects 3/150 (2%).

Seeded on 2026-09-29 from the journal and reports; the timestamp is that of the source event.
